{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story So Far\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s the 38th century. Earth is legend, long lost to time. Humanity now clings to survival on terraformed Mars \u2014 a world ruled by the Pentateuch, five cyber-priests who crushed dissent and built a brutal technocracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But rebellion sparked in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <i>Ironseed Movement</i>, a group of exiles, created a virus to dismantle the planetary AI systems and escaped aboard a stolen prototype starship. Their plan: vanish into deep space and wait for the technocracy to collapse. They were never heard from again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now, the story continues\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken alone, drifting in a crippled ship. The systems are offline. Weapons: gone. Memory: fragmented. The crew? Scattered \u2014 you are jettisoned into deep space under unknown circumstances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This wasn\u2019t the original ship. It\u2019s a backup, a failsafe \u2014 secretly loaded with your crew\u2019s preserved minds in illegal containment vessels, and launched in parallel. A second chance... but barely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain. Your first task: <strong>recover your crew</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only together can you rebuild the ship, uncover the truth, and determine what comes next. There\u2019s no clear destination. No home to return to. Just a fragile hope that somewhere out there, life can begin again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ironseed: Consensus</strong> is a sci-fi RPG of survival, exploration, and rebuilding in the aftermath of escape. Travel procedurally generated star systems, retrieve your lost crew, and forge a new path forward \u2014 through debate, disagreement, and ultimately, consensus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival is only the beginning.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Horizon Unlocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635100/4d62c1e7f07fc4e641bdca65a24014bb9ed17335.jpg"},{"name":"One Tribe's Treasure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635100/1ded5c13c468a8e8c2b040858d65a4f7bc4c8a1f.jpg"},{"name":"Into the Deep Core","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635100/856030c95e94ad08fdba837fa43abacdb7224855.jpg"},{"name":"Deprogramming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635100/ba5296a4a62a043e7c6c8270e3f5ae778f2059fc.jpg"},{"name":"His Radiance, Restored","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635100/67c4cbfa7be471d409f399e87497c31c15315522.jpg"},{"name":"Completion in Reflection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635100/ce73f8bb7c0ac1b3ccb8b0f62a300f350766c054.jpg"},{"name":"Decode the Triad","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635100/0dfc78cc73fc96d22cdb4ff52e1190fad1a9f89b.jpg"},{"name":"Forged Against the Sun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635100/5edd86dfdc9dc1772d4d63342bb4f3078911127e.jpg"},{"name":"There Was Already a Voice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635100/115fbda5bf123116adcf501a42669b5276d1c4e5.jpg"},{"name":"Consensus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3635100/aeb4efce22f8d9b3446caccb57ee49b98a51038a.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635100?t=1767973617","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635100/a01b52dff5980996908cd1dc8a021b5853bdbae6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767973617","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse